<ParahumanWikiLayout>
  <div slot="title">Jailside Street Gang</div>
  <div class="yellowWarning">This group can be territorial and dangerous. Please avoid entering the boardwalk until further notice.</div>
  <p>The Jailside Street Gang is a criminal gang claiming territory in the northeast of the city.
  The gang formed recently, and not much is known about their powers.
  </p>


  <h2>Known Members</h2>
  <h3>Antlion</h3>
  <p>It is believed that Antlion is a tinker of some sort. She wears a simple black balaclava and leather jacket
  with a stylised antlion embroidered on the back.</p>
  <div class="helpExpand">
    Help us expand this section.
    <ul>
      <li>What is Antlion's specialisation?</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <h3>Borborygmous</h3>
  <p>Borborygmous has the ability to spit blue projectiles. She wears a blue pro-wrestler mask and outfit. </p>
  <div class="helpExpand">
    Help us expand this section.
    <ul>
      <li>What effects do the projectiles have?</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <h3>Wipeout</h3>
  <p>Wipeout can shoot large quantities of metal ball-bearings from his hands. He wears a jacket with white fur trim,
  and a full face tokusatsu-like mask.</p>
  <h3>The Hand</h3>
  <p>The Hand is a floating hand that has been seen with the rest of the Jailside gang.</p>
  <p>It is uncertain if the Hand is a creation of Antlion, a manifestation of another power, or a parahuman itself.</p>
</ParahumanWikiLayout>